<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria cuts central rate to 240 pct - dealers.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria cuts central rate to 240 pct - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank (BNB) has cut the central interest rate to 240 pct from a record high of 300 percent introduced last month, commercial bank dealers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The new rate comes into effect on Friday, they said.</p>
